### Home / device page entry to album

`HomePage` composes the shell and passes the album route:

```9:24:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/apps/glasses_app/lib/app_shell/home_page.dart
/// App home page with device chrome overlays.
class HomePage extends StatelessWidget {
  const HomePage({super.key});

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return DeviceHomeShell(
      connectRoute: DeviceRoutePaths.connect,
      settingsRoute: DeviceRoutePaths.settings,
      albumRoute: DeviceAlbumRoutePaths.home,
      deviceSearchRoute: DeviceRoutePaths.search,
      // interpretationEntry uses InterpretationEntryAction default — no explicit route needed.
      floatingAction: const DeviceRecordFab(),
      body: const DeviceRecordingPage(),
    );
  }
}
```

