### Provider overrides (`app.dart`, not `main.dart`)

Both overrides live in `GlassesApp`'s `ProviderScope`:

```88:95:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart
        deviceAlbumConfigProvider.overrideWithValue(
          const DeviceAlbumConfig(saveToSystemAlbum: false),
        ),
        deviceMediaTransferClientProvider.overrideWith((ref) {
