            session: ref.read(glassesP2pSessionProvider),
          );
        }),
```

Default (un-overridden) providers in core:

```13:18:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_device_file_transfer/lib/src/provider/device_file_transfer_providers.dart
