## 2. `device_recording_page.dart` contents

Path: `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/apps/glasses_app/lib/app_shell/device_recording_page.dart` (943 lines)

This is the **device home body** (Lanhu: 设备(录音中)), not a dedicated recording-only screen. It contains:

| Section | Description |
|---|---|
| **State watches** | BLE session, connected device record, `deviceRecordControllerProvider.isRecording`, battery/wear/charging from `glassesDeviceStateProvider` |
| **`_TitleRow`** | "设备" title + add icon |
| **`_DeviceHeroSection`** | Glasses image, device name, battery/charging, connection, wear, identity sync chips |
| **`_QuickActionsRow`** | 4 tiles: 实时通讯, 同声传译 (auth-gated), object recognition (pre-connects visual stream), schedule |
| **`_PageIndicator`** | Static dot pager (non-functional) |
| **`_AiNetworkBanner`** | "开启AI联网" promo banner |
| **`_FeatureGrid`** | 9 hardcoded `_FeatureCard`s (AI助手, 录音 w/ recording badge, 日程, 生理期, AI音色, 离线翻译, 按键说明, 查找设备, 系统设置) — only 生理期 and 系统设置 have `onTap` wired |
| **`_TipsSection`** | 使用技巧 list + 问题与建议 |
| **`_BottomNavBar`** | Static 3-tab nav (设备/教程/我的) — comment says ShellRoute not wired yet |

Recording integration: watches `isRecording` to show a mic badge on the "录音" card; actual record FAB is injected by `HomePage` as `DeviceRecordFab` in the shell overlay.

