## 3. `apps/glasses_app/lib/` structure

```
apps/glasses_app/lib/
├── app.dart                    # ProviderScope overrides, MaterialApp.router
├── app_router.dart             # GoRouter + feature route groups
├── app_config.dart             # Build-time config constants
├── main.dart                   # Entry point
├── glasses_app_tokens.dart     # Theme tokens
├── unavailable_external_auth_client.dart
└── app_shell/
    ├── home_page.dart          # Wires shell + body
    ├── device_home_shell.dart  # BLE banner, top action bar, FAB slot
    └── device_recording_page.dart  # Device home UI body
```

**How feature entries are listed:** Unlike `pkg_showcase` (which uses feature-provided `*EntryItem` widgets in a grid), glasses_app uses **app-local UI**:

- **Shell-level:** IconButtons for album, settings, BLE search, interpretation
- **Body-level:** Custom `_QuickActionsRow` and `_FeatureGrid` with hardcoded Chinese labels/assets in `device_recording_page.dart`
- **FAB:** `DeviceRecordFab` from `feature_device_record` injected via shell

No `DeviceAlbumEntryItem`, `DeviceScheduleEntryItem`, etc. appear in glasses_app.

