## 4. `feature_device_album` package key pieces

### `DeviceAlbumConfig`

Full file at `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/model/device_album_config.dart`:

```1:25:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/model/device_album_config.dart
import 'package:flutter_riverpod/flutter_riverpod.dart';

/// 设备相册配置。
class DeviceAlbumConfig {
  /// 创建设备相册配置。
  const DeviceAlbumConfig({
    this.userId = 'default',
    this.saveToSystemAlbum = false,
    this.minBatteryForImport = 20,
  });

  /// 用户标识，用于隔离本地媒体目录。
  final String userId;

  /// 是否保存到系统相册。
  final bool saveToSystemAlbum;

  /// 允许导入的最低电量。
  final int minBatteryForImport;
}

/// 设备相册配置 Provider。
final deviceAlbumConfigProvider = Provider<DeviceAlbumConfig>((ref) {
  return const DeviceAlbumConfig();
});
```

Glasses app overrides with `saveToSystemAlbum: false` only (defaults for `userId` and `minBatteryForImport`).

### `DeviceAlbumEntryItem`

Full file at `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/pages/device_album_entry_item.dart`:

```8:62:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/pages/device_album_entry_item.dart
/// 设备相册入口项。
class DeviceAlbumEntryItem extends StatelessWidget {
  /// 创建设备相册入口项。
  const DeviceAlbumEntryItem({this.onTap, this.enabled = true, super.key});

  /// 点击入口时执行的动作；默认进入设备相册页。
  final VoidCallback? onTap;

  /// 是否允许点击。
  final bool enabled;

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    final tokens = DesignTokens.of(context);
    final l10n = DeviceAlbumL10n.of(context);
    final active = enabled && (onTap != null || enabled);
    return Material(
      color: active ? Colors.white : tokens.surfaceVariant.withValues(alpha: 0.72),
      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(tokens.radiusLg),
      clipBehavior: Clip.antiAlias,
      child: InkWell(
        onTap: enabled ? onTap ?? () => context.push(DeviceAlbumRoutePaths.home) : null,
        child: Padding(
          padding: EdgeInsets.all(tokens.spacingLg),
          child: Row(
            children: [
              Expanded(
                child: Column(
                  crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                  children: [
                    Text(l10n.entryTitle, ...),
                    Text(l10n.entryDescription, ...),
                  ],
                ),
              ),
              Icon(Icons.photo_library_outlined, color: tokens.accent),
            ],
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }
}
```

### Full page structure (`DeviceAlbumPage`)

`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/pages/device_album_page.dart`:

- **Scaffold** with localized app bar title
- **RefreshIndicator** → `controller.load()`
- **`_ImportPanel`**: remote file count, sync progress, Import/Cancel buttons (BLE-aware)
- **`_FilterBar`**: SegmentedButton for all/photo/video/recommend
- **Grid** (3 columns) of `_MediaTile`s, or `_EmptyState`
- **Tap** → `_PhotoViewerPage` or `_VideoPlayerPage` (media_kit)
- **Long-press** → delete confirmation → `controller.hide(item)`
- State driven by `deviceAlbumControllerProvider`, which reads `deviceMediaTransferClientProvider` and `deviceAlbumConfigProvider`

