## 5. `device_record_state.dart`

Full file at `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_record/lib/src/model/device_record_state.dart`:

```1:26:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_record/lib/src/model/device_record_state.dart
/// Immutable device recording state.
class DeviceRecordState {
  /// Creates recording state.
  const DeviceRecordState({
    this.isRecording = false,
    this.lastError,
  });

  /// Whether audio recording is active on device.
  final bool isRecording;

  /// Last protocol-level error message.
  final String? lastError;

  /// Returns a copy with selective overrides.
  DeviceRecordState copyWith({
    bool? isRecording,
    String? lastError,
    bool clearError = false,
  }) {
    return DeviceRecordState(
      isRecording: isRecording ?? this.isRecording,
      lastError: clearError ? null : (lastError ?? this.lastError),
    );
  }
}
```

Used in `DeviceRecordingPage` via `deviceRecordControllerProvider.select((s) => s.isRecording)` to show the recording badge on the "录音" feature card.

