## Wiring summary

```
main.dart → GlassesApp (app.dart)
  ├── ProviderScope overrides:
  │     deviceAlbumConfigProvider → saveToSystemAlbum: false
  │     deviceMediaTransferClientProvider → GlassesP2pMediaTransferClient
  └── MaterialApp.router → appRouter (app_router.dart)
        ├── deviceAlbumRoutes() → /device/album → DeviceAlbumPage
        └── / → HomePage
              └── DeviceHomeShell (albumRoute: /device/album)
                    ├── Top bar IconButton → context.push('/device/album')
                    ├── DeviceRecordFab (floating)
                    └── body: DeviceRecordingPage
```

If you want album as a grid card (like showcase), you'd add `DeviceAlbumEntryItem` to `_FeatureGrid` in `device_recording_page.dart` — it's exported from the feature package but not currently used in glasses_app.
